{"id": "8f921808-30ba-4c85-aeaa-cf2e03cb2baa", "slug": "system-kinetic-2025", "title": "System Kinetic 2025", "description": "System Kinetic UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"System Kinetic 2025\"\ndescription: \"System Kinetic UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFB703\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#FF5E00\"\n  background: \"#FF5E00\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Kinetic 2025\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 6; favorites: 0; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, charts, bento, webgl, threejs, navigation, flow.\n## Overview\nSystem Kinetic UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nSystem Kinetic Modal SYNC.V1 Concepts Archive Explore Space\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFB703, secondary #000000, accent #FF5E00, background #FF5E00, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse -apple-system for display moments and -apple-system for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Kinetic 2025</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#FF5E00] text-black antialiased overflow-hidden selection:bg-black selection:text-[#FFB703]\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Giant Parallax Background Typography -->\n    <div id=\"parallax-bg\" class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-10 pointer-events-none w-[150vw] mix-blend-color-burn\">\n        <div class=\"text-[18vw] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] uppercase -ml-[15vw]\">System</div>\n        <div class=\"text-[18vw] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] uppercase translate-x-[10vw]\">Kinetic</div>\n        <div class=\"text-[18vw] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] uppercase -ml-[5vw]\">Modal</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Border Gradients Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-6 pointer-events-none z-50 rounded-2xl\" style=\"border: 1px solid; border-image: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 100%) 1;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Corner Squares -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-y-0 left-12 w-[1px] bg-black/15 pointer-events-none z-40\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-y-0 right-12 w-[1px] bg-black/15 pointer-events-none z-40\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-12 left-[45px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black z-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-12 left-[45px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black z-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-12 right-[45px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black z-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-12 right-[45px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-black z-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Top Left Identity -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-12 left-16 z-50 mix-blend-difference text-white\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"font-normal tracking-tight text-sm uppercase reveal-text transform translate-y-full\">SYNC.V1</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Left Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed bottom-12 left-16 z-50 mix-blend-difference text-white flex flex-col gap-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal tracking-tight hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity block reveal-text transform translate-y-full\">Concepts</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal tracking-tight hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity block reveal-text transform translate-y-full\">Archive</a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Right Interaction Indicator -->\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-12 right-16 z-50 mix-blend-difference text-white flex items-center gap-x-3 opacity-70\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden p-1\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"1.5em\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"block reveal-text transform translate-y-full\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-tight uppercase block reveal-text transform translate-y-full\">Explore Space</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section (Three.js WebGL Container) -->\n    <section class=\"relative h-screen w-full overflow-hidden z-10\">\n        <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <script>\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // --- Masked Reveal Animation ---\n        const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n\n        gsap.to(revealElements, {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: \"body\",\n                start: \"top top\"\n            }\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js WebGL Setup ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        const aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n        const frustumSize = 28; // Slightly larger frustum for new layout\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(\n            frustumSize * aspect / -2,\n            frustumSize * aspect / 2,\n            frustumSize / 2,\n            frustumSize / -2,\n            0.1, 1000\n        );\n        camera.position.set(0, 0, 100);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // --- Texture Generation ---\n        function createTextCanvas(text, width, height, isMainFace = true) {\n            const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n            canvas.width = width;\n            canvas.height = height;\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n            ctx.fillStyle = isMainFace ? '#FFB703' : '#FFFFFF';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            if (isMainFace) {\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#000000';\n                ctx.font = '900 120px sans-serif';\n                ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n                ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n                ctx.letterSpacing = '-4px';\n\n                ctx.scale(1, 1.2);\n                ctx.fillText(text, width / 2, (height / 2) / 1.2);\n                ctx.scale(1, 1/1.2);\n            } else {\n                ctx.strokeStyle = '#000000';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 12;\n                ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n                ctx.lineJoin = 'round';\n\n                // Abstract doodle patterns for sides\n                if (text.length === 4) {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(30, 30); ctx.lineTo(width-30, height-30);\n                    ctx.moveTo(width-30, 30); ctx.lineTo(30, height-30);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                } else if (text.length === 6) {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.rect(40, 40, width-80, height-80);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                } else {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    for(let i=0; i<5; i++) {\n                        ctx.moveTo(20 + i*40, 20);\n                        ctx.lineTo(20 + i*40, height-20);\n                    }\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                }\n            }\n\n            const texture = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\n            texture.minFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\n            texture.magFilter = THREE.LinearFilter;\n            texture.generateMipmaps = false;\n            return texture;\n        }\n\n        // --- Object Creation ---\n        const blocks = [];\n        const group = new THREE.Group();\n        scene.add(group);\n\n        const materialConfig = {\n            mainBg: '#FFB703',\n            sideBg: '#FFFFFF',\n            lineColor: 0x000000\n        };\n\n        function createBlock(text, w, h, d, px, py, pz, rx, ry, rz) {\n            const geometry = new THREE.BoxGeometry(w, h, d);\n\n            const texFront = createTextCanvas(text, 1024, 256, true);\n            const texSide = createTextCanvas(text, 256, 256, false);\n\n            const matFront = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: texFront });\n            const matSideDoodle = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ map: texSide });\n            const matPlainWhite = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: materialConfig.sideBg });\n\n            const materials = [\n                matPlainWhite,\n                matSideDoodle,\n                matPlainWhite,\n                matPlainWhite,\n                matFront,\n                matPlainWhite\n            ];\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, materials);\n\n            const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geometry);\n            const lineMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: materialConfig.lineColor,\n                linewidth: 2\n            });\n            const outline = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, lineMat);\n            mesh.add(outline);\n\n            const borderGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(w + 0.15, h + 0.15, d + 0.15);\n            const borderMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x000000, side: THREE.BackSide });\n            const borderMesh = new THREE.Mesh(borderGeo, borderMat);\n            mesh.add(borderMesh);\n\n            mesh.position.set(px, py, pz);\n            mesh.rotation.set(rx, ry, rz);\n\n            group.add(mesh);\n            blocks.push({ mesh, initialY: py, rx: rx, ry: ry, rz: rz });\n            return mesh;\n        }\n\n        // --- Remixed Layout ---\n        createBlock(\"SYSTEM\",   9,  2.6, 1.5,  -5.5,  5.0,  0,   0.15,  0.1, -0.05);\n        createBlock(\"KINETIC\", 11,  2.6, 1.5,   4.5,  1.5,  0,  -0.05, -0.2,  0.1);\n        createBlock(\"MODAL\",    8,  2.6, 1.5,  -4.0, -2.0,  0,  -0.15,  0.15,  0.05);\n        createBlock(\"2025\",     6,  2.6, 1.5,   3.0, -5.5,  0,   0.2,  -0.1, -0.15);\n\n        new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(group).getCenter(group.position).multiplyScalar(-1);\n\n        group.rotation.x = -0.05;\n        group.rotation.y = 0.05;\n\n        // --- Animation Loop with Background Parallax ---\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n        const parallaxBg = document.getElementById('parallax-bg');\n\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n        const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n        });\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n            targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n\n            // 3D Group Rotation\n            group.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - group.rotation.y);\n            group.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - group.rotation.x);\n\n            // Floating Blocks\n            blocks.forEach((block, index) => {\n                block.mesh.position.y = block.initialY + Math.sin(time * 1.5 + index) * 0.4;\n                block.mesh.rotation.z = block.rz + Math.sin(time * 0.8 + index) * 0.02;\n            });\n\n            // Giant Typography Parallax Effect\n            if(parallaxBg) {\n                const bgX = -targetX * 150; // Inverse movement relative to mouse\n                const bgY = -targetY * 150;\n                parallaxBg.style.transform = `translate(calc(-50% + ${bgX}px), calc(-50% + ${bgY}px)) scale(${1 + Math.abs(targetX)*0.1})`;\n            }\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n\n        // --- Resize Handler ---\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            const aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n\n            camera.left = -frustumSize * aspect / 2;\n            camera.right = frustumSize * aspect / 2;\n            camera.top = frustumSize / 2;\n            camera.bottom = -frustumSize / 2;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n\n            if(window.innerWidth < 768) {\n                group.scale.set(0.5, 0.5, 0.5);\n            } else {\n                group.scale.set(0.95, 0.95, 0.95);\n            }\n        });\n\n        window.dispatchEvent(new Event('resize'));\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-kinetic-2025.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/system-kinetic-2025.jpg", "source_name": "system-kinetic-2025-DESIGN.md", "views": 119, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:56:29.339303+00:00"}